      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You synthesize a custom explosive payload on the fly, combining incendiary and electromagnetic charges in a single devastating burst.</p><p>Target a point within <strong>30 feet</strong>. All creatures in a <strong>15-foot burst</strong> must attempt a <strong>Reflex</strong> DC 22 save.</p><p><strong>Critical Success:</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success:</strong> Half damage.</p><p><strong>Failure:</strong> <strong>4d6 fire + 4d6 electricity</strong> damage. Electricity damage is doubled against shields.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure:</strong> <strong>8d6 fire + 8d6 electricity</strong> damage; Stunned 1.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Superior Engineer Mastery. Classes: Engineer.</em></p>"
